# Target C: reduce eight-no-root `k=6, D=-1, p=9` by functional-rank puncturing

Date: 2026-09-22

Status: rigorous structural reduction of the last `D=-1` side of the eight-no-root `k=6` layer. The puncture-functoriality proved in the preceding `D=-2,p=8` closure eliminates all virtual-deficiency-one profiles, eliminates the `d_v=2,q=9` profile and the all-singleton subcase of `d_v=2,q=8`, and forces strong all-shadow conditions on the two remaining global profiles. No new large finite census is used.

Companion arithmetic/combinatorial checker:

